{"id": "1827929", "name": "מיון נקודות אי-רציפות – (x−a)·sin(1/(x−a)), פונקציה מתנודדת", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה הפונקציה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)=\\begin{cases}{{CT:0}} &amp; x\\neq {{CT:1}}\\\\0 &amp; x={{CT:1}}\\end{cases}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle S_1\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle S_2\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle S_3\\)</span>: קבוצות נקודות האי־רציפות הסליקות, הקפיצות והאי־רציפויות העיקריות, בהתאמה.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle S_1\\) = [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle S_2\\) = [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle S_3\\) = [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-set\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: האיברים בסוגריים מסולסלים, מופרדים בפסיקים. למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">{1,-2}</code>. קבוצה ריקה: <code dir=\"ltr\">{}</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> חוסמים את הפונקציה ליד הנקודה החשודה, ומשתמשים במשפט הסנדוויץ׳.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — חסימה</b><br>הנקודה היחידה שדורשת בדיקה היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:1}}\\)</span> (בשאר הנקודות הפונקציה אלמנטרית ומוגדרת). מתקיים<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle \\left|\\left(x-{{CT:1}}\\right)\\sin\\left(\\frac{1}{x-{{CT:1}}}\\right)\\right|\\leq\\left|x-{{CT:1}}\\right|\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — משפט הסנדוויץ׳</b><br>לפי משפט הסנדוויץ׳ הגבול הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle0\\)</span>, וזה גם ערך הפונקציה בנקודה. לכן הפונקציה רציפה ואין נקודות אי־רציפות.<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle S_1={{CT:2}}\\;,\\;S_2={{CT:3}}\\;,\\;S_3={{CT:4}}\\)</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "{}", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "{}", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "{}", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "S1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.333333, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "S2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.333333, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "S3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.333334, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["S1", "S2", "S3", "a"], "nvariants": 10}